WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.998
Open Service attendance and select the right service.

00:00:05.248 --> 00:00:07.008
Check the date and start time.

00:00:07.258 --> 00:00:09.389
Enter men, women and children.

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:12.910
First-timers are already included in those numbers, so do

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.363
not add them again.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:18.078
Save once, then check the date, time and attendee

00:00:18.078 --> 00:00:19.618
total in the confirmation.

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:23.024
If a different report already exists, ask the service

00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:24.426
lead to review it.
